    "fullUrl" : "http://fhir.org/guides/onc/us-quality-core/ValueSet/us-quality-core-non-negative-event-status",
    "resource" : {
      "resourceType" : "ValueSet",
      "text" : {
        "status" : "generated",
        "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"/><p style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Expansion performed internally based on <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html\">codesystem EventStatus v4.0.1 (CodeSystem)</a><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status|4.0.1\" title=\"Click to Copy URL\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></p><p>This value set contains 7 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><tr><td><b>System</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display (en)</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>JSON</b></td><td><b>XML</b></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-preparation\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-preparation\">preparation</a></td><td>Preparation</td><td>The core event has not started yet, but some staging activities have begun (e.g. surgical suite preparation).  Preparation stages may be tracked for billing purposes.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;preparation&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Preparation&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;preparation&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Preparation&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-in-progress\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-in-progress\">in-progress</a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>The event is currently occurring.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;in-progress&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;In Progress&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;in-progress&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;In Progress&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-on-hold\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-on-hold\">on-hold</a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>The event has been temporarily stopped but is expected to resume in the future.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;on-hold&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;On Hold&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;on-hold&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;On Hold&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-stopped\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-stopped\">stopped</a></td><td>Stopped</td><td>The event was terminated prior to the full completion of the intended activity but after at least some of the 'main' activity (beyond preparation) has occurred.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;stopped&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Stopped&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;stopped&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Stopped&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-completed\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-completed\">completed</a></td><td>Completed</td><td>The event has now concluded.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;completed&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Completed&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;completed&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Completed&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-entered-in-error\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-entered-in-error\">entered-in-error</a></td><td>Entered in Error</td><td>This electronic record should never have existed, though it is possible that real-world decisions were based on it.  (If real-world activity has occurred, the status should be &quot;stopped&quot; rather than &quot;entered-in-error&quot;.).</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;entered-in-error&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Entered in Error&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;entered-in-error&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Entered in Error&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status-unknown\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-event-status.html#event-status-unknown\">unknown</a></td><td>Unknown</td><td>The authoring/source system does not know which of the status values currently applies for this event.  Note: This concept is not to be used for &quot;other&quot; - one of the listed statuses is presumed to apply,  but the authoring/source system does not know which.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Unknown&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr></table></div>"
