ext-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;entered-in-error&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Entered in Error&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status-stopped\"> </a><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-medicationdispense-status.html#medicationdispense-status-stopped\">stopped</a></td><td>Stopped</td><td>Actions implied by the dispense have been permanently halted, before all of them occurred.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;stopped&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Stopped&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;stopped&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Stopped&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status-unknown\"> </a><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-medicationdispense-status.html#medicationdispense-status-unknown\">unknown</a></td><td>Unknown</td><td>The authoring system does not know which of the status values applies for this medication dispense.  Note: this concept is not to be used for other - one of the listed statuses is presumed to apply, it's just now known which one.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Unknown&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr></table></div>"
      },
