        "status" : "generated",
        "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"/><p style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Expansion performed internally based on <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html\">codesystem ObservationStatus v4.0.1 (CodeSystem)</a><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status|4.0.1\" title=\"Click to Copy URL\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></p><p>This value set contains 7 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><tr><td><b>System</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display (en)</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>JSON</b></td><td><b>XML</b></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-registered\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-registered\">registered</a></td><td>Registered</td><td><div><p>The existence of the observation is registered, but there is no result yet available.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;registered&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Registered&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;registered&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Registered&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-preliminary\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-preliminary\">preliminary</a></td><td>Preliminary</td><td><div><p>This is an initial or interim observation: data may be incomplete or unverified.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;preliminary&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Preliminary&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;preliminary&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Preliminary&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-final\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-final\">final</a></td><td>Final</td><td><div><p>The observation is complete and there are no further actions needed. Additional information such &quot;released&quot;, &quot;signed&quot;, etc would be represented using <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/provenance.html\">Provenance</a> which provides not only the act but also the actors and dates and other related data. These act states would be associated with an observation status of <code>preliminary</code> until they are all completed and then a status of <code>final</code> would be applied.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;final&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Final&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;final&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Final&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-amended\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-amended\">amended</a></td><td>Amended</td><td><div><p>Subsequent to being Final, the observation has been modified subsequent.  This includes updates/new information and corrections.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;amended&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Amended&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;amended&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Amended&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-corrected\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-corrected\">corrected</a></td><td>Corrected</td><td><div><p>Subsequent to being Final, the observation has been modified to correct an error in the test result.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;corrected&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Corrected&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;corrected&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Corrected&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-entered-in-error\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-entered-in-error\">entered-in-error</a></td><td>Entered in Error</td><td><div><p>The observation has been withdrawn following previous final release.  This electronic record should never have existed, though it is possible that real-world decisions were based on it. (If real-world activity has occurred, the status should be &quot;cancelled&quot; rather than &quot;entered-in-error&quot;.).</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;entered-in-error&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Entered in Error&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;entered-in-error&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Entered in Error&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status-unknown\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html#observation-status-unknown\">unknown</a></td><td>Unknown</td><td><div><p>The authoring/source system does not know which of the status values currently applies for this observation. Note: This concept is not to be used for &quot;other&quot; - one of the listed statuses is presumed to apply, but the authoring/source system does not know which.</p>\n</div></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Unknown&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Unknown&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr></table></div>"
      },
