      "text" : {
        "status" : "generated",
        "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"/><p style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Expansion performed internally based on <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html\">codesystem TaskStatus v4.0.1 (CodeSystem)</a><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status|4.0.1\" title=\"Click to Copy URL\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></p><p>This value set contains 11 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\" data-fhir=\"generated\"><tr><td><b>System</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display (en)</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>JSON</b></td><td><b>XML</b></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-draft\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-draft\">draft</a></td><td>Draft</td><td>The task is not yet ready to be acted upon.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;draft&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Draft&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;draft&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Draft&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-requested\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-requested\">requested</a></td><td>Requested</td><td>The task is ready to be acted upon and action is sought.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;requested&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Requested&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;requested&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Requested&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-received\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-received\">received</a></td><td>Received</td><td>A potential performer has claimed ownership of the task and is evaluating whether to perform it.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;received&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Received&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;received&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Received&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-accepted\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-accepted\">accepted</a></td><td>Accepted</td><td>The potential performer has agreed to execute the task but has not yet started work.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Accepted&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;accepted&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Accepted&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-ready\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-ready\">ready</a></td><td>Ready</td><td>The task is ready to be performed, but no action has yet been taken.  Used in place of requested/received/accepted/rejected when request assignment and acceptance is a given.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;ready&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Ready&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;ready&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Ready&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-cancelled\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-cancelled\">cancelled</a></td><td>Cancelled</td><td>The task was not completed.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;cancelled&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Cancelled&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;cancelled&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Cancelled&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-in-progress\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-in-progress\">in-progress</a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>The task has been started but is not yet complete.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;in-progress&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;In Progress&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;in-progress&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;In Progress&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-on-hold\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-on-hold\">on-hold</a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>The task has been started but work has been paused.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;on-hold&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;On Hold&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;on-hold&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;On Hold&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-failed\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-failed\">failed</a></td><td>Failed</td><td>The task was attempted but could not be completed due to some error.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;failed&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Failed&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt