tem-task-status.html#task-status-requested\">requested</a></td><td>Requested</td><td>The task is ready to be acted upon and action is sought.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;requested&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Requested&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;requested&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Requested&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-received\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-received\">received</a></td><td>Received</td><td>A potential performer has claimed ownership of the task and is evaluating whether to perform it.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;received&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Received&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;received&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Received&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-accepted\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-accepted\">accepted</a></td><td>Accepted</td><td>The potential performer has agreed to execute the task but has not yet started work.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Accepted&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;accepted&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Accepted&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-ready\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-ready\">ready</a></td><td>Ready</td><td>The task is ready to be performed, but no action has yet been taken.  Used in place of requested/received/accepted/rejected when request assignment and acceptance is a given.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;ready&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Ready&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;ready&quot;&gt;&lt;di