lue=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;in-progress&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;In Progress&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-on-hold\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-on-hold\">on-hold</a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>The task has been started but work has been paused.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;on-hold&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;On Hold&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;4.0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;on-hold&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;On Hold&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status-failed\"> </a><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-task-status.html#task-status-failed\">failed</a></td><td>Failed</td><td>The task was attempted but could not be completed due to some error.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/task-status&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.0.1&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;failed&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Failed&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt